<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $1.00-1.25 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $1.00-1.25 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00-1.25 higher. Top $59.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    59.00-59.50, Near 100 head 59.75</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    58.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    56.50-57.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    55.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs 0.25 higher; 450-500 lbs 1.50-2.00 higher; 500-650 lbs 1.50-3.50 higher. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    45.00-45.25</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    47.00-47.50, few 48.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    48.00-50.00</p>
</text>
